    "This manual covers the interface and basic operations of the App Manager: browsing installed applications, viewing app details, and uninstalling applications.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This manual covers the interface and basic operations of the App Manager: browsing installed applications, viewing app details, and uninstalling applications."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手册介绍应用管理器的界面与基本操作:浏览已安装的应用、查看应用详情以及卸载应用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手冊介紹應用管理器的介面與基本操作:瀏覽已安裝的應用、查看應用詳情以及解除安裝應用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手冊介紹應用管理器的介面與基本操作:瀏覽已安裝的應用、查看應用詳情以及解除安裝應用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手冊介紹應用管理器的介面與基本操作:瀏覽已安裝的應用、查看應用詳情以及解除安裝應用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
